    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Salamander inferno masters are ancient experts in flame who often dwell in places of unusual, searing heat. They gather circles of apprentices who learn fiery arts while helping their masters carry out great works. Their ambitions are grand: triggering huge volcanic eruptions, opening gateways to burning planes, destroying Artifacts, or burning every trace of something out of the multiverse.</p>",
